{"seq":1,"slug":"harness-architecture","title":"Harness 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/harness-architecture","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"harness-架构\">Harness 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML Harness 是封装和管理机器学习工作流的工程框架。&quot;Harness&quot;（线束/框架）的含义是为 ML 系统的各个组件提供统一的连接和控制界面，就像汽车线束将电子元件连接为一个整体。一个设计良好的 Harness 架构使团队能够以标准化、可扩展的方式开发、测试和部署 ML 模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[配置层] --&gt; B[编排引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; C[插件系统]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数据插件]&#10;    C --&gt; E[训练插件]&#10;    C --&gt; F[评估插件]&#10;    C --&gt; G[部署插件]&#10;    B --&gt; H[执行运行时]&#10;    H --&gt; I[本地/K8s/云端]\">graph TB\n    A[配置层] --&gt; B[编排引擎]\n    B --&gt; C[插件系统]\n    C --&gt; D[数据插件]\n    C --&gt; E[训练插件]\n    C --&gt; F[评估插件]\n    C --&gt; G[部署插件]\n    B --&gt; H[执行运行时]\n    H --&gt; I[本地/K8s/云端]</pre><p>Harness 架构的核心设计目标是将 ML 工作流的&quot;变化部分&quot;（模型架构、数据处理逻辑）与&quot;稳定部分&quot;（编排、监控、容错）分离。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计目标</th>\n<th>实现手段</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化</td>\n<td>统一接口和协议</td>\n<td>降低团队间协作成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展</td>\n<td>插件化架构</td>\n<td>新功能无需改框架核心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可复现</td>\n<td>配置即代码</td>\n<td>任何实验可一键重现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测</td>\n<td>内置指标和日志</td>\n<td>问题快速定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错</td>\n<td>检查点和重试</td>\n<td>长时间任务稳定运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多环境</td>\n<td>运行时抽象</td>\n<td>本地开发到云端部署无缝切换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"插件化架构设计\">插件化架构设计</h2><p>插件化是 Harness 架构的灵魂。ML 工作流中的每个环节（数据加载、模型定义、训练循环、评估指标、部署目标）都抽象为插件接口，用户通过实现接口来定制行为，框架负责插件的发现、加载和生命周期管理。</p>\n<p>插件接口的设计需要在灵活性和简洁性之间找到平衡。过于简单的接口无法覆盖复杂场景，过于复杂的接口降低了易用性。PyTorch Lightning 的 Callback 系统是优秀的插件设计范例——它在训练循环的每个关键节点（epoch 开始/结束、batch 开始/结束、验证阶段等）提供钩子，用户通过继承 Callback 基类并重写特定钩子方法来注入自定义逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from abc import ABC, abstractmethod&#10;from typing import Any&#10;&#10;class DataPlugin(ABC):&#10;    @abstractmethod&#10;    def load_train_data(self, config: dict) -&gt; Any:&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;    @abstractmethod&#10;    def load_eval_data(self, config: dict) -&gt; Any:&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;class ModelPlugin(ABC):&#10;    @abstractmethod&#10;    def create_model(self, config: dict) -&gt; Any:&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;    @abstractmethod&#10;    def create_optimizer(self, model: Any, config: dict) -&gt; Any:&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;class TrainerPlugin(ABC):&#10;    @abstractmethod&#10;    def train_step(self, model: Any, batch: Any) -&gt; dict:&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;    @abstractmethod&#10;    def eval_step(self, model: Any, batch: Any) -&gt; dict:&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;class PluginRegistry:&#10;    _plugins: dict = {}&#10;&#10;    @classmethod&#10;    def register(cls, name: str, plugin_cls: type):&#10;        cls._plugins[name] = plugin_cls&#10;&#10;    @classmethod&#10;    def get(cls, name: str) -&gt; type:&#10;        return cls._plugins[name]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Any</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ABC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> load_train_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> Any:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> load_eval_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> Any:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModelPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ABC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> Any:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_optimizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model: Any, config: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> Any:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TrainerPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ABC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model: Any, batch: Any) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @abstractmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> eval_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model: Any, batch: Any) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PluginRegistry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _plugins: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">classmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cls, name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, plugin_cls: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        cls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._plugins[name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plugin_cls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">classmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cls, name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._plugins[name]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>插件发现机制通常基于 Python 的 Entry Points（setuptools）或约定式的目录扫描。用户将自定义插件打包为 Python 包，通过 entry_points 注册到 Harness 框架，框架在启动时自动扫描并加载所有注册的插件。这种机制使得第三方可以开发和分享插件，形成生态系统。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Harness Core] --&gt; B[Plugin Registry]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Data Plugins]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Model Plugins]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Trainer Plugins]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Deploy Plugins]&#10;    G[配置文件] --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[Harness Core] --&gt; B[Plugin Registry]\n    B --&gt; C[Data Plugins]\n    B --&gt; D[Model Plugins]\n    B --&gt; E[Trainer Plugins]\n    B --&gt; F[Deploy Plugins]\n    G[配置文件] --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"pipeline-抽象与-dag-执行\">Pipeline 抽象与 DAG 执行</h2><p>Harness 将 ML 工作流抽象为 Pipeline——由多个 Step 组成的有向无环图。每个 Step 封装一个原子操作（数据加载、特征工程、训练、评估等），Step 之间通过 Artifact（数据产物）连接。</p>\n<p>Pipeline 的执行引擎负责解析 DAG 依赖关系、调度 Step 执行、管理 Artifact 传递和处理错误恢复。执行模式包括本地顺序执行（开发调试）、本地并行执行（利用多核 CPU）和分布式执行（提交到 Kubernetes 集群）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class StepConfig:&#10;    name: str&#10;    plugin: str&#10;    inputs: list[str]&#10;    outputs: list[str]&#10;    params: dict&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class PipelineConfig:&#10;    name: str&#10;    steps: list[StepConfig]&#10;&#10;class PipelineEngine:&#10;    def __init__(self, config: PipelineConfig, registry: PluginRegistry):&#10;        self.config = config&#10;        self.registry = registry&#10;        self.artifacts = {}&#10;&#10;    def run(self):&#10;        execution_order = self._topological_sort()&#10;        for step_config in execution_order:&#10;            plugin = self.registry.get(step_config.plugin)()&#10;            inputs = {name: self.artifacts[name] for name in step_config.inputs}&#10;            outputs = plugin.execute(inputs, step_config.params)&#10;            for name, artifact in zip(step_config.outputs, outputs):&#10;                self.artifacts[name] = artifact&#10;&#10;    def _topological_sort(self):&#10;        visited = set()&#10;        order = []&#10;        for step in self.config.steps:&#10;            self._dfs(step, visited, order)&#10;        return order\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StepConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugin: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inputs: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    outputs: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PipelineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    steps: list[StepConfig]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PipelineEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config: PipelineConfig, registry: PluginRegistry):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.registry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.artifacts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        execution_order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._topological_sort()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> execution_order:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            plugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.registry.get(step_config.plugin)()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.artifacts[name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step_config.inputs}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plugin.execute(inputs, step_config.params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, artifact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(step_config.outputs, outputs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.artifacts[name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> artifact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _topological_sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        visited </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.config.steps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._dfs(step, visited, order)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置即代码（Configuration as Code）是 Pipeline 定义的核心原则。Pipeline 的结构、参数和执行策略都通过 YAML 或 Python 配置文件声明，存储在版本控制系统中，确保每次实验都可以精确复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩展机制与自定义-hook\">扩展机制与自定义 Hook</h2><p>除了插件系统，Harness 还需要提供细粒度的扩展机制，让用户在不修改框架代码的情况下注入自定义逻辑。Hook（钩子）和 Callback（回调）是两种主要的扩展模式。</p>\n<p>Hook 系统在框架的关键执行点预留了扩展接口。例如训练循环中的 <code>on_train_begin</code>、<code>on_batch_start</code>、<code>on_batch_end</code>、<code>on_epoch_end</code> 等。用户注册的 Hook 函数在对应时机被调用，可以执行指标记录、学习率调整、早停检查、检查点保存等横切关注点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class HookManager:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.hooks: dict[str, list] = {}&#10;&#10;    def register(self, event: str, callback):&#10;        self.hooks.setdefault(event, []).append(callback)&#10;&#10;    def trigger(self, event: str, **kwargs):&#10;        for callback in self.hooks.get(event, []):&#10;            callback(**kwargs)&#10;&#10;class EarlyStoppingHook:&#10;    def __init__(self, patience=5, min_delta=0.001):&#10;        self.patience = patience&#10;        self.min_delta = min_delta&#10;        self.best_score = None&#10;        self.counter = 0&#10;&#10;    def on_epoch_end(self, metrics, trainer):&#10;        score = metrics.get(&quot;val_loss&quot;, float(&quot;inf&quot;))&#10;        if self.best_score is None or score &lt; self.best_score - self.min_delta:&#10;            self.best_score = score&#10;            self.counter = 0&#10;        else:&#10;            self.counter += 1&#10;            if self.counter &gt;= self.patience:&#10;                trainer.stop_training = True\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HookManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.hooks: dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, event: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, callback):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.hooks.setdefault(event, []).append(callback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, event: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> callback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.hooks.get(event, []):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            callback(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EarlyStoppingHook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, patience</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, min_delta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.patience </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> patience</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.min_delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.best_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on_epoch_end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, metrics, trainer):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"val_loss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.best_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.best_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.min_delta:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.best_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.patience:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                trainer.stop_training </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Mixin 模式是另一种灵活的扩展方式。通过多重继承，用户可以将多个功能模块（如分布式训练能力、混合精度训练能力、梯度累积能力）组合到训练器中，而无需修改基类代码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扩展模式</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>侵入性</th>\n<th>组合性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Plugin</td>\n<td>粗粒度（组件级）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>注册替换</td>\n<td>替换整个数据/训练/评估流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hook/Callback</td>\n<td>细粒度（事件级）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>多个并行</td>\n<td>注入横切关注点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mixin</td>\n<td>中粒度（能力级）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>多重继承</td>\n<td>组合正交能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decorator</td>\n<td>细粒度（函数级）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>嵌套组合</td>\n<td>包装单个函数行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多环境运行时\">多环境运行时</h2><p>Harness 架构需要支持在不同环境中运行同一个 Pipeline：开发者本地机器、CI/CD 服务器、GPU 训练集群和生产推理环境。运行时抽象层屏蔽了不同环境的差异，让 Pipeline 代码无需修改即可在任何环境中执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[Pipeline 定义] --&gt; B[运行时抽象]&#10;    B --&gt; C[本地运行时]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Docker 运行时]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Kubernetes 运行时]&#10;    B --&gt; F[云端运行时]&#10;    C --&gt; G[开发调试]&#10;    D --&gt; H[CI/CD 测试]&#10;    E --&gt; I[分布式训练]&#10;    F --&gt; J[生产部署]\">graph TB\n    A[Pipeline 定义] --&gt; B[运行时抽象]\n    B --&gt; C[本地运行时]\n    B --&gt; D[Docker 运行时]\n    B --&gt; E[Kubernetes 运行时]\n    B --&gt; F[云端运行时]\n    C --&gt; G[开发调试]\n    D --&gt; H[CI/CD 测试]\n    E --&gt; I[分布式训练]\n    F --&gt; J[生产部署]</pre><p>运行时抽象的核心接口包括：资源申请（CPU/GPU/内存）、Artifact 存储（本地文件/S3/GCS）、日志和指标输出（标准输出/MLflow/W&amp;B）、Secret 管理（环境变量/Vault）。每个运行时实现这些接口，Pipeline 代码只依赖抽象接口而非具体实现。</p>\n<p>Hydra 和 OmegaConf 是配置管理的常用工具，它们支持配置的层次化组合、命令行覆盖和环境变量插值。通过配置组合，同一个 Pipeline 可以用不同的配置运行在不同环境中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Harness 架构))&#10;    插件系统&#10;      数据插件&#10;      模型插件&#10;      训练插件&#10;      部署插件&#10;    Pipeline&#10;      DAG 编排&#10;      Artifact 传递&#10;      配置即代码&#10;    扩展机制&#10;      Hook/Callback&#10;      Mixin 模式&#10;      Decorator&#10;    运行时&#10;      本地开发&#10;      Docker/K8s&#10;      云端生产\">mindmap\n  root((Harness 架构))\n    插件系统\n      数据插件\n      模型插件\n      训练插件\n      部署插件\n    Pipeline\n      DAG 编排\n      Artifact 传递\n      配置即代码\n    扩展机制\n      Hook/Callback\n      Mixin 模式\n      Decorator\n    运行时\n      本地开发\n      Docker/K8s\n      云端生产</pre><ul>\n<li>Harness 架构将 ML 工作流的变化部分与稳定部分分离，通过插件化实现灵活扩展</li>\n<li>Pipeline 抽象将 ML 工作流组织为 DAG，配置即代码保证了实验的可复现性</li>\n<li>Hook/Callback 系统提供了细粒度的扩展能力，是注入横切关注点的标准模式</li>\n<li>多环境运行时抽象使 Pipeline 可以无修改地在开发到生产的各个环境中运行</li>\n<li>好的 Harness 设计是 ML 团队工程效率的倍增器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Harness 架构","id":"harness-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"插件化架构设计","id":"插件化架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Pipeline 抽象与 DAG 执行","id":"pipeline-抽象与-dag-执行"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展机制与自定义 Hook","id":"扩展机制与自定义-hook"},{"level":2,"text":"多环境运行时","id":"多环境运行时"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批量与实时推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/serving-and-inference/batch-vs-realtime"},"next":{"title":"生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/lifecycle-management"}}